      "widgets_values": [
        "GK H3 Dataset Builder - FULL BUILD\n\n1. Set 'source_folder' to a folder of large videos.\n2. Set 'target_folder' to where the dataset should be written.\n3. (Optional) Set 'trigger_word' to a unique LoRA activation token; it is\n   prepended to every clip's description (right after [Shot 1]). Blank = off.\n4. Run. Each source video is cut into H3-valid clips (17*n+5 frames @ 24fps),\n   768p / 32 kHz stereo (H3-Base defaults), transcribed with Whisper, and\n   captioned by the local Qwen3.8 VLM into T2VA .txt files + metadata.jsonl.\n\nSegmentation: 'scene_detect' (default), 'fixed_window', 'single_clip', or\n'speech_aware' (align cuts to dialogue - see example 06).\nSet resize_height=0 / audio_sample_rate=0 to keep source values.\n\nRequires: ffmpeg on PATH, and ComfyUI_Qwen_H3_Prompt installed (models +\nruntime) for captioning. scenedetect enables scene-aware segmentation."
      ],
      "title": "README"
    },
